    "detailed_description": "Explore a huge world on a quad! Discover landmarks, people, and much more. Make your own story by either taking a relaxing drive or racing to become number 1.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Full VR Support</strong> - Project Quad was made for VR with full visuals and motion controls.<br></li><li><strong>A Career Mode</strong> - Continuously expanding for the known future with updates for free!<br></li><li><strong>A Large World to Explore</strong> - Also continuously expanding giving you new places to explore every update.<br></li><li><strong>Vehicle Customization</strong> - Upgrade your vehicle using a simple monetary system just like early 2000's racing games.<br></li><li><strong>Multiplayer</strong> - Explore and race your friends online!<br></li><li><strong>Updates</strong> - Continuous updates for the known future as I intend on creating one of the best VR and racing experiences I have ever known.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Explore a huge world on a quad! Discover landmarks, people, and much more. Make your own story by either taking a relaxing drive or racing to become number 1.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Full VR Support</strong> - Project Quad was made for VR with full visuals and motion controls.<br></li><li><strong>A Career Mode</strong> - Continuously expanding for the known future with updates for free!<br></li><li><strong>A Large World to Explore</strong> - Also continuously expanding giving you new places to explore every update.<br></li><li><strong>Vehicle Customization</strong> - Upgrade your vehicle using a simple monetary system just like early 2000's racing games.<br></li><li><strong>Multiplayer</strong> - Explore and race your friends online!<br></li><li><strong>Updates</strong> - Continuous updates for the known future as I intend on creating one of the best VR and racing experiences I have ever known.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Embark on an adrenaline-fueled adventure through diverse terrains on your quad! Whether you're racing towards the pinnacle or leisurely exploring uncharted territories.",
